{"dialogue": {"lines": [{"en": "Listen, guests are coming this evening.", "hi": "सुनो, आज शाम मेहमान आ रहे हैं।", "r": "Shono, aj shondhay otithi ashchhen.", "sp": "Mother", "t": "শোনো, আজ সন্ধ্যায় অতিথি আসছেন।"}, {"en": "Who is coming, mother?", "hi": "कौन आ रहे हैं, माँ?", "r": "Kara ashchhen, ma?", "sp": "Son", "t": "কারা আসছেন, মা?"}, {"en": "Your uncle and aunt. Tidy the room.", "hi": "तुम्हारे मामा-मामी। कमरा तरतीब से रखो।", "r": "Tomar mama-mamima. Ghorta guchhiye rakho.", "sp": "Mother", "t": "তোমার মামা-মামিমা। ঘরটা গুছিয়ে রাখো।"}, {"en": "OK. What will be cooked?", "hi": "अच्छा। क्या बनेगा?", "r": "Achchha. Ki ranna hobe?", "sp": "Son", "t": "আচ্ছা। কী রান্না হবে?"}, {"en": "Rice, lentils and fish curry.", "hi": "भात, दाल और मछली का झोल।", "r": "Bhat, ḍal, ar machher jhol.", "sp": "Mother", "t": "ভাত, ডাল, আর মাছের ঝোল।"}, {"en": "Wow! I'll fetch sweets from the market.", "hi": "वाह! मैं बाज़ार से मिठाई लाता हूँ।", "r": "Bah! Ami bajar theke mishṭi anchhi.", "sp": "Son", "t": "বাহ! আমি বাজার থেকে মিষ্টি আনছি।"}], "title": "Guests for dinner"}, "lede": "Rooms, kitchens, relatives and daily chores — the Bengali of home.", "phrases": [{"en": "Come home early", "hi": "जल्दी घर आओ", "r": "Taṛataṛi baṛi esho", "t": "তাড়াতাড়ি বাড়ি এসো"}, {"en": "Dinner is ready", "hi": "खाना तैयार है", "r": "Khabar toiri", "t": "খাবার তৈরি"}, {"en": "Wash your hands", "hi": "हाथ धो लो", "r": "Hat dhuye nao", "t": "হাত ধুয়ে নাও"}, {"en": "Go to sleep now", "hi": "अब सो जाओ", "r": "Ebar ghumiye poṛo", "t": "এবার ঘুমিয়ে পড়ো"}, {"en": "Where are the keys?", "hi": "चाबियाँ कहाँ हैं?", "r": "Chabighulo kothay?", "t": "চাবিগুলো কোথায়?"}, {"en": "Lock the door", "hi": "दरवाज़े पर ताला लगाओ", "r": "Dorjay tala dao", "t": "দরজায় তালা দাও"}, {"en": "The guests are coming", "hi": "मेहमान आ रहे हैं", "r": "Otithira ashchhen", "t": "অতিথিরা আসছেন"}, {"en": "Make some tea", "hi": "थोड़ी चाय बनाओ", "r": "Ektu cha koro", "t": "একটু চা করো"}, {"en": "Help your mother", "hi": "अपनी माँ की मदद करो", "r": "Make shahajjo koro", "t": "মাকে সাহায্য করো"}, {"en": "This is my home", "hi": "यह मेरा घर है", "r": "Eṭa amar baṛi", "t": "এটা আমার বাড়ি"}, {"en": "Our family is big", "hi": "हमारा परिवार बड़ा है", "r": "Amader poribar boṛo", "t": "আমাদের পরিবার বড়"}, {"en": "Sweet dreams", "hi": "मीठे सपने", "r": "Mishṭi shopno", "t": "মিষ্টি স্বপ্ন"}], "quiz": [{"a": "kitchen", "explain": "রান্নাঘর (rannaghor) = kitchen — রান্না = cooking.", "id": "bq-65", "lesson": "home", "level": "beginner", "opts": ["kitchen", "bedroom", "bathroom", "balcony"], "q": "রান্নাঘর means…", "topic": "home", "type": "vocab"}, {"a": "মামা", "explain": "মামা (mama) = maternal uncle; কাকা is paternal younger uncle.", "id": "bq-66", "lesson": "home", "level": "beginner", "opts": ["মামা", "কাকা", "জ্যাঠা", "দাদু"], "q": "Which is 'maternal uncle'?", "topic": "home", "type": "vocab"}, {"a": "dinner is ready", "explain": "খাবার তৈরি — তৈরি = ready.", "id": "bq-67", "lesson": "home", "level": "beginner", "opts": ["dinner is ready", "wash your hands", "go to sleep", "lock the door"], "q": "'খাবার তৈরি' means…", "topic": "home", "type": "meaning"}, {"a": "ঘরটা গুছিয়ে রাখো", "explain": "ঘরটা গুছিয়ে রাখো = tidy the room — গুছিয়ে = tidily.", "id": "bq-68", "lesson": "home", "level": "elementary", "opts": ["ঘরটা গুছিয়ে রাখো", "বাইরে খেলো", "ঘুমিয়ে পড়ো", "বই পড়ো"], "q": "Guests are coming — tell the child to tidy the room…", "topic": "home", "type": "usage"}, {"a": "key", "explain": "চাবি (chabi) = key — চাবিগুলো কোথায়? (where are the keys?)", "id": "bq-69", "lesson": "home", "level": "beginner", "opts": ["key", "lock", "door", "window"], "q": "চাবি means…", "topic": "home", "type": "vocab"}, {"a": "afternoon nap", "explain": "ভাতঘুম (bhatghum) — the sacred post-lunch nap. ভাত = rice!", "id": "bq-70", "lesson": "home", "level": "elementary", "opts": ["afternoon nap", "morning walk", "night sleep", "daydream"], "q": "ভাতঘুম means…", "topic": "home", "type": "vocab"}, {"a": "lock the door"